      [#D7D7AF][/dim]get a visible repair flag.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_date_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/task_date_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-53[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-53/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Date marks in bob-ledger-tools[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]date-marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]date-marks: add the pure date-mark core (a parser for several canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]date fields per line, the calendar label grammar, tooltips, the element,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the widget). Add the Live Preview extension with whitespace-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]folding and per-field reveal, the rendered-view post-processor, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]midnight rollover relabel, the session toggle, `api.dateMarks` v1, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the CSS glyph set, tones, and repair flag. Add the conformance tests and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the authoritative `docs/date-marks.md` contract, then deploy with `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins sync`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Date marks in Tasks query results[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]tasks-results[dim] · [dim][/dim]after date-marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks-results: in full-mode Tasks query results, add the same mark to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each date component through a bounded per-row frame pass. The date-mark [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-processor triggers the pass, and it falls back to Tasks' native [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]emoji dates. In short-mode results, CSS swaps the emoji for the glyph. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Extend the tests, contract, README, and manifest, then deploy.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-53","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-53.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e7748d28f20b830e3bcf3172fc5fa292","started_at":"2026-10-07T12:43:32.668731+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"5218adb6adf335bbb39abcf37261baf430180e10e3a6d67a1e0fe0de4a8cfd6e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":7583},"commits":{"digest":"a8f9b7ab02d32234187faaadeb319a0b95f90f4963850dbb0132af2125561763","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"c5a99104b680b78e5859373f0cbc2cb3fed5ec04c6effc40662c9499d7780374","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":821},"prompt":{"digest":"0ac5e338216006040056186b815279a6fe5104d6ef95f5a5fd9b57637908cadc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":186},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"f984bbbf37cee440d38658a94a2c055671179018cdcbe57fcb929c4264ac10c1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.land--plan/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7412},"state":{"digest":"d938c11fc7a00be65d7ff91d50ed033688f5ed0f5342c5affd053494657b9332","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-53.lan